            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.4.1+NUM.4.2+NUM.4.3+NUM.4.4+NUM.4.5+NUM.4.6+NUM.4.7+NUM.4.8+NUM.4.9+NUM.4.10+NUM.4.11+NUM.4.12+NUM.4.13+NUM.4.14+NUM.4.15+NUM.4.16+NUM.4.17+NUM.4.18+NUM.4.19+NUM.4.20+NUM.4.21+NUM.4.22+NUM.4.23+NUM.4.24+NUM.4.25+NUM.4.26+NUM.4.27+NUM.4.28+NUM.4.29+NUM.4.30+NUM.4.31+NUM.4.32+NUM.4.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:1-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.8.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali nokukutumika, kabili bali nokubomba imilimo yonse iya mwi Tenti lya cipangano. Lelo tabali nakupalama ku fipe ifyaba mu cifulo camushilo, nangu ku bulambo. Nga bacita ifyo, ninshi bonse iwe na bena mukafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakulabomba na imwe, kabili bali nokulasunga Itenti Lyakukumaninamo no kubomba imilimo yonse iye Tenti. Kabili umuntu nangu umo talingile kupalama mupepi napo muli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli nokubaka icifulo camushilo pamo no bulambo, epakuti nikafulilwa abena Israeli nakabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nine winefye nasala aba mu lupwa lwa bena Levi banobe ukufuma pa bena Israeli nge cabupe kuli iwe. Kabili nabalubwila kuli Yawe, pakuti balebomba mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo iwe pamo na bana bobe abaume, nimwe mwakulabomba imilimo yonse iyabushimapepo iya ku bulambo na mukati ka cisalu cakucingako. Ala nine nakupeela umulimo wa bushimapepo ngo bupe. Umuntu umbi uwaisa no kupalama ku cifulo camushilo afwilefye ukwipaiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Aroni ati, “Nine wine nakupeela insambu shakumona pa fyamutuulo upeelwa kuli ine. Imituulo yamushilo yonse abena Israeli bantuula nakupeela pamo na bana bobe abaume ukuba e ciputulwa cenu ico bakulamwakanyako lyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mituulo yamushilo icine cine iyo mushocele pa mulilo, imwe mwakulakwatapo iciputulwa. Pa fyabupe fyonse ifyo bandetela ngo mutuulo wamushilo icine cine, cibe imituulo ya cabunga, nangu imituulo yakwelelwa pa bubifi, nangu imituulo yakufuta pa fyabubifi, fyena ifi fyobe pamo na bana bobe abaume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulelya ifi fintu nge fyamushilo icine cine. Kabili baumefye balingile ukulyako. Mufwile ukufimona nge fyamushilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Fimbi nafyo pa fyabupe ne mituulo nakupeela nifi. Icilifye conse icapatulwapo pa mutuulo wakutambika uwa bena Israeli, napeela ici ku bana bobe abaume na banakashi, nge ciputulwa cenu ica lyonse. Umuntu onse uwa mu ŋanda yobe nga ali uwasangululwa, kuti alyako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ine nakupeela amafuta ya miolifa ayawamisha no mwangashi uwawamisha ne ŋanu, ifisabo fyabo fyantanshi ifyo bapeela kuli Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fyonsefye ifisabo fyantanshi ifyo batuula Yawe fili nokuba fyobe. Umuntu onse uwa mu ŋanda yobe nga ali uwasangululwa, kuti alyako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
